<title>UK: GECC sets $150 million five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>GECC sets $150 million five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Morgan Stanley International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     6.75	MATURITY  **26.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.675   PAY DATE    26.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    100.05    SPREAD	+27 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**CALLABLE ON 26.FEB.99 AT PAR</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
